         <patent:Title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Photographic printing apparatus</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="de">Fotografisches DruckgerÃ¤t</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="en">Photographic printing apparatus</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="fr">Imprimante photographique</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </patent:Title>
         <patent:Abstract>
            <rdf:Seq>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="en">A photographic printing apparatus (1) includes a sorting apparatus (ST) comprising a plurality of receptacles (FR,PR) for receiving negative films (2) and prints which circulate in a closed loop of path between a film loading station (C) in close proximity to an exposure apparatus (EX) and a print loading station where prints cut from a continuous web of photographic paper are delivered, the receptacles (FR,PR) being driven such that each receptacle related to a receptacle loaded with a specific negative film at the film loading station is positioned in the print loading station timely before a cluster (3A) of prints made from the specific negative film is delivered from the photographic printing apparatus. [image]</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Seq>
         </patent:Abstract>
