<</CreationDate(D:20100504021020+01'00')/Subject(A photographic printing apparatus \(1\) includes a sorting apparatus \(ST\) comprising a plurality of receptacles \(FR,PR\) for receiving negative films \(2\) and prints which circulate in a closed loop of path between a film loading station \(C\) in clos\
e proximity to an exposure apparatus \(EX\) and a print loading station where prints cut from a continuous web of photographic paper are delivered, the receptacles \(FR,PR\) being driven such that each receptacle related to a receptacle loaded with a spec\
ific negative film at the film loading station is positioned in the print loading station timely before a cluster \(3A\) of prints made from the specific negative film is delivered from the photographic printing apparatus. [image])/PDFVersion(1.4)/Creator(Jouve S.A., TaggedPDF v1.27)/Keywords("EP0750228"; "EP 0750228"; "G03D 15/00"; "Photographic printing apparatus")/Producer(Adobe PDF Library 8.0)/ModDate(D:20100717204339+02'00')/Title(Photographic printing apparatus - European Patent Office - EP 0750228 A1)>>
endobj
